  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.17 Order of Proceeding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.17 Order of Proceeding. In hearings on petitions, or motions, the party that has the burden of proof pursuant to Puc 204.16 shall have the opportunity to present first and last in any hearing in the proceeding.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.26)",
